00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.280
This is how one team lines up.

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:14.250
That's crazy!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:15.650
There's nothing crazy about it.

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:19.280
Numbers one through eight 
are the big forwards,

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:22.050
and numbers nine through fifteen
are the little backs.

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:25.590
If you want to know more, 
you can look it up yourself.

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:27.780
Ume-chan, that's not much of an explanation...

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:30.540
Question! What position would I play?

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.790
U-Uh... as a winger?

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.640
A winger?

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:38.890
I don't know what that is,
but it sounds cool!

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:40.500
Hey, short stuff.

00:20:41.850 --> 00:20:44.220
I'm a winger, too.

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:45.460
Ya-ha!

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.860
You're seriously tiny!

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:49.220
Are you starting high school
in six years' time?

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.680
You jerk...

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.060
What's this? You wanna fight?

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:57.940
The newbies aren't playing in 
this match, so forget about it.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:00.940
I'll play, even if I have to go through you.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:05.820
Ebucchi, you sure you'll make the team
after taking the week off?

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.490
Cram it, Isei!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.740
Unlike me, you suck ass!

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:11.960
You're the one who should watch himself!

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:13.330
What?!

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:17.100
Shut up! I hope that midget takes your
 position on the wing away from you!

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.260
"Midget"?

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:19.300
What? You wanna fight, huh?

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:21.460
Bring it on!

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:24.050
There's no way a midget like you
would take my spot from me!

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.800
Hey, listen...

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:26.920
You called me a midget again!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.230
Shut up!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.920
Jeez, those guys...

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.210
What should we do with them, Taku?

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.210
You wanna fight, Isei? Huh?

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.210
Hey!

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:31.220
What's going on in your head, huh?

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:32.180
Don't mess with me, Lion!

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.460
Asshole!

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:34.270
Hachioji-senpai...

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:40.190
I don't... have to play, do I?

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:48.050
Keijo High

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:48.050
Saturday, 14:00

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:48.050
Meet @ 12:00, Jinko Front Gate

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:55.460
Whoa there! Slow down a little, Miyuki.

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.150
Yes, sir.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.190
I just can't wait to play.

00:22:05.140 --> 00:22:08.220
Ten more, please.

